{"content_hash": "0d5d31956293be0d", "version_id": 883, "article_id": 89, "level_code": "en_b1", "lang": "en", "level": 3, "level_label": "B1 中级", "title": "Nvidia app update adds DLSS tuning for 19 games", "title_zh": "英伟达应用更新，19款游戏支持DLSS优设", "has_translation": true, "topic": "tech", "source": "ithome", "source_url": "https://www.ithome.com/1/023/068.htm", "image": {"type": "photo", "url": "https://images.unsplash.com/photo-1719763031152-e9a4bcb12a3e?ixid=M3wxMDk3Mzk1fDB8MXxzZWFyY2h8Nnx8YXBwJTIwZGxzc3xlbnwwfDB8fHwxNzkzOTI5NDkwfDA&ixlib=rb-4.1.0&w=1600&q=75&fm=jpg&fit=max", "provider": "unsplash", "credit": "Photo by Indra Projects on Unsplash", "author": "Indra Projects", "credit_url": "https://unsplash.com/@indraprojects?utm_source=daily-english-news&utm_medium=referral", "source": "Unsplash", "source_url": "https://unsplash.com/photos/a-close-up-of-a-computer-screen-with-many-different-app-icons-S4QZnvK5Mvg?utm_source=daily-english-news&utm_medium=referral", "fallback": {"type": "gradient", "from": "hsl(9, 42%, 62%)", "to": "hsl(47, 46%, 48%)", "label": "TECH", "seed": "0171d0c216a0"}}, "published_date": "2026-11-06", "word_count": 197, "reading_minutes": 1.0, "lead": "Nvidia has released a new version of its app, and it brings better settings for many popular games. Players can now get smoother graphics with less work, because the app suggests the best options for them.", "lead_zh": "英伟达发布了新版应用，为许多热门游戏带来了更好的设置。玩家现在能更省力地获得更流畅的画面，因为应用会自动推荐最佳选项。", "preview": "The new update is called version 11.0.9.585. It adds DLSS tuning support for 19 games, including PUBG: BATTLEGROUNDS and The Witcher 3: Wild", "preview_zh": "这次更新的版本号是 11.0.9.585。它为 19 款游戏新增了 DLSS 优设支持，其中包括《绝地求生：大逃杀》和《巫师 3：狂猎》。DLSS 是一项能让游戏运行更快、同时保持画面清晰的技术，所以配置较弱的玩家也能流畅游玩。", "has_audio": true, "audio": {"id": 866, "url": "https://pub-aba43a6fb1db4dc08fede1dbc81f3241.r2.dev/audio/89/en_b1.mp3", "duration": 88.275, "size_bytes": 530640, "engine": "kokoro", "voice": "af_heart", "word_count": 231, "has_timeline": true, "alternates": [{"voice": "af_bella", "url": "https://pub-aba43a6fb1db4dc08fede1dbc81f3241.r2.dev/audio/89/en_b1_af_bella.mp3", "duration": 91.15, "size_bytes": 547920, "engine": "kokoro", "word_count": 231, "has_timeline": true, "timeline_url": "https://pub-aba43a6fb1db4dc08fede1dbc81f3241.r2.dev/timeline/89/en_b1_af_bella.json"}, {"voice": "am_michael", "url": "https://pub-aba43a6fb1db4dc08fede1dbc81f3241.r2.dev/audio/89/en_b1_am_michael.mp3", "duration": 96.425, "size_bytes": 579456, "engine": "kokoro", "word_count": 231, "has_timeline": true, "timeline_url": "https://pub-aba43a6fb1db4dc08fede1dbc81f3241.r2.dev/timeline/89/en_b1_am_michael.json"}, {"voice": "bf_emma", "url": "https://pub-aba43a6fb1db4dc08fede1dbc81f3241.r2.dev/audio/89/en_b1_bf_emma.mp3", "duration": 82.1, "size_bytes": 493488, "engine": "kokoro", "word_count": 231, "has_timeline": true, "timeline_url": "https://pub-aba43a6fb1db4dc08fede1dbc81f3241.r2.dev/timeline/89/en_b1_bf_emma.json"}, {"voice": "bm_george", "url": "https://pub-aba43a6fb1db4dc08fede1dbc81f3241.r2.dev/audio/89/en_b1_bm_george.mp3", "duration": 89.125, "size_bytes": 535680, "engine": "kokoro", "word_count": 231, "has_timeline": true, "timeline_url": "https://pub-aba43a6fb1db4dc08fede1dbc81f3241.r2.dev/timeline/89/en_b1_bm_george.json"}]}, "detail_url": "https://cdn.jsdelivr.net/gh/chjam12301-sys/news-etl@cf016b9/content/data/versions/883.json", "paragraphs": ["The new update is called version 11.0.9.585. It adds DLSS tuning support for 19 games, including PUBG: BATTLEGROUNDS and The Witcher 3: Wild Hunt. DLSS is a feature that helps games run faster while keeping the picture sharp, so players with weaker computers can still enjoy them.", "The app also adds a new \"optimal settings\" profile for six games. These include AION 2, Aniimo, Control: Resonance, EA SPORTS FC 27, Gears of War: E-Day and Star Wars: Galactic Racer. If a player owns one of these games, the app can choose good graphics settings for them automatically.", "This update follows two earlier versions with even more features. Version 11.0.9 added DLSS 4.5 Ray Reconstruction and a Resizable BAR control for single games. After that, version 11.0.9.565 added support for RTX Spark, as well as CPU clock, power and temperature stats.", "Users can find the DLSS tuning options in the app under Graphics, then Program Settings, then Driver Settings. Although these changes are small, they save time because players no longer need to test settings by hand.", "Nvidia has also released a Game Ready 621.14 driver, which improves World of Warcraft: Midnight and fixes a video black-screen problem."], "paragraphs_zh": ["这次更新的版本号是 11.0.9.585。它为 19 款游戏新增了 DLSS 优设支持，其中包括《绝地求生：大逃杀》和《巫师 3：狂猎》。DLSS 是一项能让游戏运行更快、同时保持画面清晰的技术，所以配置较弱的玩家也能流畅游玩。", "应用还为 6 款游戏新增了“最佳设置”配置文件，包括《永恒之塔 2》《伊莫》《控制：共振》《EA SPORTS FC 27》《战争机器：事变日》和《星球大战：银河赛车手》。如果玩家拥有其中一款游戏，应用就能自动为其挑选合适的画质设置。", "在这次更新之前，英伟达还推出了两个功能更多的版本。11.0.9 主版本新增了 DLSS 4.5 光线重建，以及针对单款游戏的 Resizable BAR 控制选项。随后发布的 11.0.9.565 版本增加了对 RTX Spark 的支持，并加入 CPU 时钟频率、功耗和温度等统计数据。", "用户可以在应用的“图形”>“程序设置”>“驱动程序设置”中找到 DLSS 优设相关选项。虽然这些改动不大，但能节省时间，因为玩家不必再手动测试设置。", "英伟达还发布了 Game Ready 621.14 驱动，优化了《魔兽世界：无限》，并修复了视频黑屏问题。"], "body": "The new update is called version 11.0.9.585. It adds DLSS tuning support for 19 games, including PUBG: BATTLEGROUNDS and The Witcher 3: Wild Hunt. DLSS is a feature that helps games run faster while keeping the picture sharp, so players with weaker computers can still enjoy them.\n\nThe app also adds a new \"optimal settings\" profile for six games. These include AION 2, Aniimo, Control: Resonance, EA SPORTS FC 27, Gears of War: E-Day and Star Wars: Galactic Racer. If a player owns one of these games, the app can choose good graphics settings for them automatically.\n\nThis update follows two earlier versions with even more features. Version 11.0.9 added DLSS 4.5 Ray Reconstruction and a Resizable BAR control for single games. After that, version 11.0.9.565 added support for RTX Spark, as well as CPU clock, power and temperature stats.\n\nUsers can find the DLSS tuning options in the app under Graphics, then Program Settings, then Driver Settings. Although these changes are small, they save time because players no longer need to test settings by hand.\n\nNvidia has also released a Game Ready 621.14 driver, which improves World of Warcraft: Midnight and fixes a video black-screen problem.", "body_zh": "这次更新的版本号是 11.0.9.585。它为 19 款游戏新增了 DLSS 优设支持，其中包括《绝地求生：大逃杀》和《巫师 3：狂猎》。DLSS 是一项能让游戏运行更快、同时保持画面清晰的技术，所以配置较弱的玩家也能流畅游玩。\n\n应用还为 6 款游戏新增了“最佳设置”配置文件，包括《永恒之塔 2》《伊莫》《控制：共振》《EA SPORTS FC 27》《战争机器：事变日》和《星球大战：银河赛车手》。如果玩家拥有其中一款游戏，应用就能自动为其挑选合适的画质设置。\n\n在这次更新之前，英伟达还推出了两个功能更多的版本。11.0.9 主版本新增了 DLSS 4.5 光线重建，以及针对单款游戏的 Resizable BAR 控制选项。随后发布的 11.0.9.565 版本增加了对 RTX Spark 的支持，并加入 CPU 时钟频率、功耗和温度等统计数据。\n\n用户可以在应用的“图形”>“程序设置”>“驱动程序设置”中找到 DLSS 优设相关选项。虽然这些改动不大，但能节省时间，因为玩家不必再手动测试设置。\n\n英伟达还发布了 Game Ready 621.14 驱动，优化了《魔兽世界：无限》，并修复了视频黑屏问题。", "text": "The new update is called version 11.0.9.585. It adds DLSS tuning support for 19 games, including PUBG: BATTLEGROUNDS and The Witcher 3: Wild Hunt. DLSS is a feature that helps games run faster while keeping the picture sharp, so players with weaker computers can still enjoy them. The app also adds a new \"optimal settings\" profile for six games. These include AION 2, Aniimo, Control: Resonance, EA SPORTS FC 27, Gears of War: E-Day and Star Wars: Galactic Racer. If a player owns one of these games, the app can choose good graphics settings for them automatically. This update follows two earlier versions with even more features. Version 11.0.9 added DLSS 4.5 Ray Reconstruction and a Resizable BAR control for single games. After that, version 11.0.9.565 added support for RTX Spark, as well as CPU clock, power and temperature stats. Users can find the DLSS tuning options in the app under Graphics, then Program Settings, then Driver Settings. Although these changes are small, they save time because players no longer need to test settings by hand. Nvidia has also released a Game Ready 621.14 driver, which improves World of Warcraft: Midnight and fixes a video black-screen problem.", "vocab": [{"word": "update", "pos": "noun", "zh": "更新", "note": "常指软件的新版本", "phonetic": "", "en": ""}, {"word": "support", "pos": "noun", "zh": "支持", "note": "add support for 表示新增对某物的支持", "phonetic": "", "en": ""}, {"word": "sharp", "pos": "adj", "zh": "清晰的", "note": "形容画面清楚锐利", "phonetic": "", "en": ""}, {"word": "profile", "pos": "noun", "zh": "配置文件", "note": "这里指预设的一组设置", "phonetic": "", "en": ""}, {"word": "automatically", "pos": "adv", "zh": "自动地", "note": "由系统完成，无需人工操作", "phonetic": "", "en": ""}, {"word": "feature", "pos": "noun", "zh": "功能", "note": "软件或产品提供的特性", "phonetic": "", "en": ""}, {"word": "release", "pos": "verb", "zh": "发布", "note": "常用于软件、驱动、产品", "phonetic": "", "en": ""}, {"word": "driver", "pos": "noun", "zh": "驱动程序", "note": "让硬件正常工作的软件", "phonetic": "", "en": ""}, {"word": "option", "pos": "noun", "zh": "选项", "note": "可供选择的一项设置", "phonetic": "", "en": ""}, {"word": "by hand", "pos": "phrase", "zh": "手动地", "note": "指人工操作，而非自动完成", "phonetic": "", "en": ""}], "fetched_at": "2026-11-06T01:44:48.078996", "timeline": [{"i": 0, "w": "The", "s": 0.275, "e": 0.35, "sm": 275, "em": 349, "cs": 0, "ce": 3, "si": 0}, {"i": 1, "w": "new", "s": 0.35, "e": 0.525, "sm": 350, "em": 524, "cs": 4, "ce": 7, "si": 0}, {"i": 2, "w": "update", "s": 0.525, "e": 0.975, "sm": 525, "em": 975, "cs": 8, "ce": 14, "si": 0}, {"i": 3, "w": "is", "s": 0.975, "e": 1.125, "sm": 975, "em": 1125, "cs": 15, "ce": 17, "si": 0}, {"i": 4, "w": "called", "s": 1.125, "e": 1.438, "sm": 1125, "em": 1437, "cs": 18, "ce": 24, "si": 0}, {"i": 5, "w": "version", "s": 1.438, "e": 1.825, "sm": 1437, "em": 1824, "cs": 25, "ce": 32, "si": 0}, {"i": 6, "w": "11.0.9.585", "s": 1.825, "e": 4.075, "sm": 1825, "em": 4075, "cs": 33, "ce": 43, "si": 0}, {"i": 7, "w": ".", "s": 4.075, "e": 4.2, "sm": 4075, "em": 4200, "cs": 43, "ce": 44, "si": 0}, {"i": 8, "w": "It", "s": 